 "summary": "Relates to payment in construction contracts; specifies the meaning of \"substantial completion\" for the purposes of requisition payments in construction contracts.",
 "title": "Relates to payment in construction contracts",
 "vetoMessages": {
  "items": [
   {
    "billId": {
